 pieces. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Gina is passionate about fashion trends. (event_time: 2023-03-16T14:35:00Z)\n  - Gina is the owner of the online clothing store and enjoys being her own boss. (event_time: 2023-06-16T21:38:00Z)\n  - Gina found a cool new fashion piece. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina feels a mix of excitement and fear regarding getting into fashion (event_time: 2023-05-27T19:18:00Z)\n  - Gina wanted to blend her love for dance with fashion. (event_time: 2023-03-16T14:35:00Z)\n  - The video presentation developed by Gina teaches how to style fashion pieces. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Gina finds looking for new fashion trends keeps her motivated to continue growing. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Gina plans to share the new fashion piece with her customers. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina states that fashion fuels her creativity. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Gina intends to work to make Jon's studio shine. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Gina owns a clothing store. (event_time: 2023-01-29T14:32:00Z)\n  - Gina's store will have the new fashion piece available. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina wanted to blend her love for Dance with fashion. (event_time: 2023-03-16T14:35:00Z)\n  - Gina was noticed by fashion editors. (event_time: 2023-07-02T00:00:00Z)\n  - Gina designed the spot for her store. (event_time: 2023-02-01T00:48:00Z)\n  - Combining Dance and fashion allows Gina to show her creativity. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Gina got the idea for a fashion piece from a fashion mag (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - fashion internship: Gina was accepted for a part-time fashion internship at an international company's fashion department. Jon congratulated her.\n  - fashion: Gina secured a part-time fashion internship at an international company, expressin