 generated answer accurately mentions the 'big family reunion' and specifies the time frame as 'next summer', which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about the family event Evan is planning for next summer. It explicitly states that Evan is planning a 'big family reunion' next summer, which directly matches the golden answer. Additionally, the context includes related details about the reunion, such as the anticipation of family members attending and its purpose, which further supports the completeness of the information provided.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Evan is planning a big family reunion next summer."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_3","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_3_qa_78","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How many video game tournaments has Nate participated in?","golden_answer":"nine","hypothesis":"Nate has participated in several video game tournaments, as indicated by the following memories:\n\n1. Nate attended a video game tournament on January 23, 2022.\n2. Nate participated in a video game tournament recently on September 5, 2022.\n3. Nate participated in the local Street Fighter tournament on May 2, 2022.\n4. Nate participated in a tournament that was tough on November 9, 2022.\n5. Nate participated in the final of a big Valorant tournament on November 5, 2022.\n\nCounting these events, Nate has participated in a total of **five video game tournaments**.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual tim