k is great and she will love it.\n  - seeing all of the characters and dialogue I wrote being acted out: Joanna experienced seeing all of the characters and dialogue she wrote being acted out, which was rewarding and the third time this has happened to her.\n  - writing projects: Joanna is busy with writing projects, which she finds to be the best thing ever, a mix of highs and lows. Writing is an escape, a way to express feelings, and healing.\n  - writers group: Joanna shared her book with her writers group last week and received great feedback. She recently finished a cute little bookmark for one of the ladies at her writing club.\n  - old notebooks: Joanna found old notebooks containing her early writings last week, showing her progress. Nate asked Joanna what she was working on in that notebook.\n  - Max's walk: Joanna is relaxing this weekend by taking a long walk and reading as a break.\n  - writing gig: Joanna had an audition yesterday for a writing gig, feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety afterward. Nate previously encouraged her, noting her hard work and passion.\n  - writing conventions: Joanna expressed interest in writing conventions after Nate mentioned attending a game convention, suggesting she might look into attending one.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2028,"context_chars":8425,"retrieval_duration":0.20212531089782715,"response_duration":2.13399338722229,"total_duration":2.336118698120117,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer accurately reflects Joanna's plans to submit her screenplay to film festivals and seek attention from producers and directors, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about Joanna's plans for her finished screenplay in January 2022. It explicitly states that Joanna plans to submit her screenplay to film festivals and intends for producers and directors to check it out, which aligns p