rs therapeutic.\n  - teenagers: Calvin recalled freestyling with people when they were teenagers, referencing those days while feeling nostalgic.\n  - engineer: Dave became an engineer and works on car projects, which Calvin finds inspiring for his music career.\n  - fame: Calvin, inspired by a friend attending his performance, reflected on how relationships and being around certain people spark feelings from when he and friends talked about getting famous as teenagers.\n  - opportunity: Calvin mentioned being greatly privileged to have been granted this opportunity, which he finds satisfying to bring back to life.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - car restoration: Dave restored and modified a car himself, adding a custom exhaust and performance upgrades. Calvin congratulated Dave on his awesome job and skills.\n  - Boston: Calvin mentioned catching up with Dave when he is in Boston. Dave is interested in attending an event there.\n  - California Love: Dave mentioned to Calvin that \"California Love\" is a classic song and suggested jamming to music together.\n  - Frank Ocean: Calvin is on tour with Frank Ocean. Calvin finds the tour awesome but occasionally overwhelming due to many demands, yet pushes on.\n  - mark: Calvin mentioned that every 'mark' and strum holds a story when discussing his performance on a big stage.\n  - team: Calvin mentioned his team is part of his strong support system that helps him manage his overwhelming job demands. He was also with his crew at a fancy gala in Boston.\n  - Cal: Calvin (Cal) works with new talent, making a beat for a young artist with great music potential. He enjoys seeing his old friends who support him.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1993,"context_chars":8060,"retrieval_duration":0.12224006652832031,"response_duration":2.959550142288208,"total_duratio